              ≡⟨ sym (⋆Assoc C _ _ _) ⟩
                (h ⋆⟨ C ⟩ pbPr₂ ⋁Pullback) ⋆⟨ C ⟩ (restCone β β∈L') .coneOut (sing i)
              ≡⟨ cong (λ x → x ⋆⟨ C ⟩ (restCone β β∈L') .coneOut (sing i)) (sym tr₂) ⟩
