  f (inl (x)) + f (inr (pt B))    ---[cong f (push tt)⁻¹]--->
  f (inl (x)) + f (inl (pt A))    ---[(**)]--->
  f (inl (x)) + 0                 ---[right-unit]--->
  f (inl (x))

and then Pᵣ by
  f (inl (pt A)) + f (inr (x))    ---[(**)⁻¹]--->
  0 + f (inr (x))                 ---[left-unit]--->
  f (inr (x))

and finally by using the fact that the group laws for Kₙ are refl at its base point.
