  ℤ[X]/X→H*R-Unit = Quotient-FGideal-CommRing-Ring.inducedHom ℤ[X] (H*R Unit) ℤ[X]→H*-Unit <X> ℤ[x]→H*-Unit-cancelX

  ℤ[x]/x→H*-Unit : ℤ[x]/x → H* Unit
  ℤ[x]/x→H*-Unit = fst ℤ[X]/X→H*R-Unit



