        m3 ≡ 99 ∷ 86 ∷ 78 ∷ 31 ∷ 13 ∷ 9 ∷ 9 ∷ 5 ∷ 4 ∷ 3 ∷ 3 ∷ 1 ∷ 1 ∷ 0 ∷ []
